🛠 Issues & Troubleshooting Log
❌ Issue 1: Public Access Not Permitted

Error:

PublicAccessNotPermitted


Cause:
Storage account had public access disabled.

Solution:
Used protectedSettings with storageAccountKey instead of enabling public blob.

❌ Issue 2: no-hardcoded-env-urls Warning

Cause:
Used core.windows.net directly.

Solution:
Replaced with:

${environment().suffixes.storage}

❌ Issue 3: Custom Script Exit Status = 1

Cause:
qemu-img used backing file without specifying backing format.

Solution:
Added:

-F qcow2

❌ Issue 4: Disk Created Before Base Image

Cause:
qemu-img executed before downloading base image.

Solution:
Corrected execution order in script.

❌ Issue 5: Shared Folder Not Visible

Cause:
9p filesystem not auto-mounted in Ubuntu cloud image.

Solution:
Manually loaded modules:

modprobe 9p
modprobe 9pnet_virtio


Mounted manually.

❌ Issue 6: Inner VM Login Confusion

Cause:
Ubuntu cloud image default user is ubuntu.

Solution:
Logged in using:

ubuntu / azureuser

